  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU supplies support to Veterinary and Phytosanitary sectors in Bosnia and Herzegovina, Lot 2: Emergency preparedness and fieldwork equipmen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contract will provide the veterinary and phytosanitary services in Bosnia and Herzegovina with specific emergency and fieldwork equipment for their increased efficiency in animal health control measures. It will enhance the sectoral performance and contribute to their gradual alignment to the EU requirements and standards.</narrative>
  </description>
